{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/steam_text_story.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game of Fitna: Vol 1</strong> takes place in <strong>2030</strong> at <strong>Preisotus High School \u2013 Wisdom Heaven</strong>, an elite academy where only the best can attend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Zayn</strong>, the lowest-ranked student in the school. One day, you receive a mysterious message about a <strong>TEST</strong>. Soon, you realize you're not alone\u2014six of your classmates have been pulled into it as well. There's no way to refuse, and no way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed by the school itself, this trial is more than just a test. It\u2019s a game of strategy, trust, and deception\u2014where failure comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inspired by psychological thrillers, high-stakes death games, and Arabian folklore, Game of Fitna is a story of ambition, morality, and the price of success.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you make it through?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/steam_text_characters.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/steam_characters_ALL.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Game of Fitna Vol.1\u00a0</i>, you will meet a cast of different ideologies and characters, each carrying their own burdens. Some may be allies, others enemies, and some will blur the line between the two. You'll have the chance to talk to them, uncover bits of their truths\u2014but be careful. In a game like this, trust is a dangerous gamble.<br><br><strong>The Protagonist of this story, Zayn \u2013 Ranked 100</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/profile_zayn_eng__1_.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Noor, The Humanist \u2013 Ranked 99</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/profile_noor_eng.png?t=1744977799\" /><br><strong>Adam, The Anarchist \u2013 Ranked 98</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/profile_adam_eng.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Belial, The Greedy \u2013 Ranked 97</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/profile_belial_eng.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sultan, The King \u2013 Ranked 96</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/profile_sultan_eng.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ehsan, The Prince \u2013 Ranked 95</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/profile_ehsan_eng.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sabier, The Perfectionist \u2013 Ranked 94</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/profile_sabier_eng.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/steam_text_features.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 13 hours of captivating story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A haunting original soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 unique bad endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 50 hand-crafted CGs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An immersive and dynamic presentation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A rich and atmospheric setting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complex and compelling characters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thought-provoking moral dilemmas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging and strategic mechanics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>...And much, much more!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2725340?t=1744977799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744977799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/92b702f50a21331bc19acd7edeeef63512e1ea56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744977799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/92b702f50a21331bc19acd7edeeef63512e1ea56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744977799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/steam_text_story.png?t=1744977799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game of Fitna: Vol 1</strong> takes place in <strong>2030</strong> at <strong>Preisotus High School \u2013 Wisdom Heaven</strong>,